# User Stories

1. As a visitor, I want to browse a gallery of the artist's paintings, so that I can see the style and range of their work.

2. As a potential client, I want to read about the artist's background, so that I can decide whether their style fits what I'm looking for.

3. As an interested buyer, I want to contact the artist through a form on the site, so that I can inquire about commissions or pricing.